From: Evangelos <skoeva@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 10:45:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] app: support product-specific tray icons

Allow branded Headlamp packages to select a resource-relative tray icon while preserving the built-in Headlamp assets as the default. Reject paths outside packaged resources and resize custom macOS icons for native menu-bar rendering.
